    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The game comes with a full CG archive for an enjoyable gaming experience.</h2>All game materials are officially authorized.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Plot Summary:</h2><br>&quot;Harris&quot; is an outstanding bounty hunter.<br>He received a mission from the Adventurer's Guild to find a missing girl, thus embarking on an adventure. In Hagar Town, he met the shy and lovely girl-next-door &quot;Anna,&quot; and the two developed feelings for each other. Later, while recruiting teammates, he encountered the energetic and passionate female warrior &quot;Adoni,&quot; who was also looking for teammates. Additionally, he met the sadistic and thrill-seeking female ninja &quot;Kagura.&quot; You join them in their adventure and gradually delve into their hearts.<br>From then on, the adventure is filled with the applause of love.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Character Introduction:</h2><br><strong>Anna</strong>\uff1a<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1544090/extras/bfc21c52d742180fca27b5b42ca6c407.avif?t=1695753742\" /></div><br>She appears shy at first glance but is a devoted and lovely girl.<br><br><strong>Adoni</strong>\uff1a<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1544090/extras/ac45e9a467643732183a6da27ef7af2f.avif?t=1695753742\" /></div><br>Always energetic, but she can be shy in certain situations.<br><br><strong>Kagura</strong>\uff1a<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1544090/extras/88f3df7365e742fb555f57d24b9e8232.avif?t=1695753742\" /></div><br>She seems aloof, but in private, she's as passionate as fire and never lets up.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Embark on an adventure with the protagonist and find love along the way.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Easy-to-learn, strategy-rich turn-based combat.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Distinctive classes and unique skills, with each class possessing powerful ultimate abilities.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Avoid monsters through positioning and enjoy relatively free battle choices.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>An equipment synthesis system makes the gaming experience even more interesting.</li></ul><br>Publisher Miss Banana has now been renamed Hera Games. Thank you for your support!",
